 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Monitoring of Goods and Invoice Receipts (2V7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>, the GR/IR monitor is an application that helps the accountants to process the cases where the goods receipts and the invoices receipts are not exactly matched and written off automatically. The processors set the statuses to purchase orders to indicate the next actions that must be taken in the context of certain purchase order. A machine learning feature of the GRIR application makes a prediction of the next status based on the history of processing. The predictions are provided by a Machine Learning (ML) service that runs on the Cloud Foundry. This communication scenario is related to the connection of the <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> backend and the ML service.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reconcile GR/IR accounts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor GR/IR account reconciliation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use a Situation Handling template for the GR/IR Reconciliation Monitor</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Propose status of goods and invoice receipts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Propose status dependent on the situation of a purchase order item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce efforts in manual checks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate with Machine Learning for Monitoring of Goods and Invoice Receipts (2ZS) scope item</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>收货和收发票监控 (2V7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中，GR/IR 监控器是一个应用程序，可帮助会计处理收货和收发票不完全匹配并自动注销的情况。处理人将状态设置为采购订单，以指示在特定采购订单的上下文中必须采取的后续操作。GRIR 应用程序的机器学习功能根据处理历史记录预测下一状态。预测由在 Cloud Foundry 上运行的机器学习 (ML) 服务提供。此通信场景与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 后端和 ML 服务的连接相关。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">统驭 GR/IR 科目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控 GR/IR 科目对账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将情况处理模板用于 GR/IR 对账监控器</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6cec27d3a525441c8f985365da26f6ed__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">建议收货和收发票状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据采购订单项目的情况，建议状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少手动检查的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">与监控收货和收发票 (2ZS) 范围项目的机器学习集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
